{# PROBLEM SECTION - The Traditional Approach Destroys Teeth #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>The Traditional Approach Destroys Teeth</h2>
      <p>Most dentists drill aggressively, place crowns that leak, and perform root canals that lead to tooth failure.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>All Crowns Eventually Leak</h3>
        <p>Traditional crowns create hiding places for bacteria. Once bacteria gets underneath, it's impossible to clean, leading to decay and eventual tooth failure.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card">
        <h3>The Cycle of Destruction</h3>
        <p>Filling → bigger filling → crown → crown replacement → root canal → extraction. Each step weakens your tooth further until it's lost forever.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Why It Persists</h3>
        <p>Traditional dentistry is faster and more profitable. Crowns can be placed quickly, but they don't preserve your natural tooth structure like biomimetic approaches.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

